---
/**
 * The hairline frame behind a section: a full-height rule down each gutter
 * edge plus 26px tick marks on the 17% and 55% column lines.
 *
 * These four rules are the page's grid made visible — the section content is
 * laid out against the same 0 / 17 / 55 / 100 % positions, which is what stops
 * the sections reading as unsorted. Colours flip with the section ground; see
 * `.rules` in global.css. Each rule grows downwards on entry, staggered.
 */
---

<div class="rules" aria-hidden="true" data-rules>
  <span></span>
  <span></span>
  <span></span>
  <span></span>
</div>
